    <!-- Sources -->
    <string name="sources_title">Sources</string>
    <string name="sources_policy">RulePlay summarises the rules of each sport in its own words. Summaries are not official rule text and are not endorsed by any federation. We link to each governing body so you can read the current official rulebook, and we only show a rule number when it matches the official numbering.</string>
    <string name="sources_links_checked">%1$d of %2$d rulebook links were checked as reachable on the date shown next to each one. Federations update their documents regularly, so editions can change.</string>
    <string name="sources_governing_bodies">Governing bodies referenced</string>
    <string name="sources_acknowledgements">Acknowledgements</string>
    <string name="sources_fonts">Typefaces: Bebas Neue (Dharma Type) and Inter (Rasmus Andersson), both under the SIL Open Font License 1.1.</string>
    <string name="sources_art">Cover photos come from Wikimedia Commons under the licence shown for each one (Creative Commons or public domain); they were cropped, resized and colour-graded. Sports without a photo use original artwork generated on-device by RulePlay. No federation imagery is used.</string>
    <string name="sources_trademarks">Names of competitions, leagues and organisations are trademarks of their respective owners and are used for identification only.</string>

